#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Intltool"
msgstr "Instalação do Intltool"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid "First fix a warning that is caused by perl-5.22 and later:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija um aviso que é causado pelo perl-5.22 e posteriores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:87
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i 's:\\\\\\${:\\\\\\$\\\\{:' intltool-update.in</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i 's:\\\\\\${:\\\\\\$\\\\{:' intltool-update.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The above regular expression looks unusual because of all the backslashes.  "
"What it does is add a backslash before the right brace character in the "
"sequence '\\${' resulting in '\\$\\{'."
msgstr ""
"A expressão regular acima parece incomum por causa de todas as barras "
"invertidas. O que ela faz é adicionar uma barra invertida antes do caractere"
" de chave de fechamento na sequência '\\${', resultando em '\\$\\{'."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Intltool</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Intltool</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:102
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/intltool.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 -D doc/I18N-HOWTO -t /usr/share/doc/intltool-&intltool-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 -D doc/I18N-HOWTO -t /usr/share/doc/intltool-&intltool-version;</userinput>"

